                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-mistakes",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Mistakes to Avoid When Searching for Semi Truck Parts",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "mistakes"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-mistakes-1",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing Based on Price Alone",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "price-alone"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-mistakes-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Cheaper parts can lead to faster wear and tear, more frequent repairs, and higher long-term costs. The better investment is quality and reliability.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-mistakes-3",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Working with Multiple Vendors",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "multiple-vendors"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-mistakes-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "While it might seem flexible, working with multiple providers often leads to miscommunication, delays in service, and a lack of accountability. Having one trusted partner simplifies everything.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-mistakes-5",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ignoring Preventive Maintenance",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "ignoring-maintenance"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-mistakes-6",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Even the best parts won't help if maintenance is inconsistent. A strong dealer will help you stay ahead with service reminders, maintenance scheduling, and ongoing support.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-growth",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How the Right Dealer Supports Your Growth",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "growth"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-growth-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "As your business grows, your needs change. A dependable truck parts dealer grows with you by scaling inventory access, supporting larger fleets, and providing consistent service across locations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-growth-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, our goal is to provide everything you need, from parts to service, so you can focus on running your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-partner",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Partner with a Team You Can Count On",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "partner"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-partner-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At the end of the day, choosing a truck parts dealer comes down to trust. You need a partner who shows up when they say they will, provides quality parts and service, and keeps your business moving forward. Visit the <a href=\"https://www.sunstateparts.com/login\">Online Parts Store</a> to get the parts you need today. <a href=\"/service-appointment\">Schedule a Service Appointment</a> with Sun State International and keep your fleet running strong.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
